sequenceDiagram
    participant C as MCP Client
    participant SDK as mcp Server (server.app)
    participant LST as server.list_tools
    participant TS as tool_specs
    participant CT as server.call_tool
    participant DT as server.dispatch_tool
    participant H as _handle_call_backend_tool
    participant BM as ctx.backend_manager

    Note over C,BM: tools/list：定义由注册表单一来源产出
    C->>SDK: tools/list
    SDK->>LST: list_tools()
    LST->>TS: build_mcp_tools()
    Note over TS: 逐条 ServerToolSpec 构造 Tool<br/>annotations / outputSchema 在此统一挂载
    TS-->>LST: list[Tool]
    LST-->>SDK: tools
    SDK-->>C: tools

    Note over C,BM: tools/call（成功路径）：查表分发，handler 只依赖注入的 ctx
    C->>SDK: tools/call call_backend_tool
    SDK->>CT: call_tool(name, arguments)
    CT->>DT: dispatch_tool(name, arguments)
    DT->>TS: get_spec(name)
    TS-->>DT: ServerToolSpec
    DT->>H: handler(arguments, _TOOL_CONTEXT)
    H->>H: _needs_destructive_confirm(ctx.registry.get_tool(...), tool_name)
    H->>BM: ctx.backend_manager.call_backend_tool(tool_id, tool_name, args)
    BM-->>H: dict（success / result）
    H-->>DT: payload dict
    DT-->>CT: JSON text（统一 json.dumps）
    CT-->>SDK: CallToolResult(content + structuredContent)
    SDK-->>C: result

    Note over C,BM: tools/call（失败路径）：业务错误仍以异常冒泡给 SDK
    C->>SDK: tools/call ghost_tool
    SDK->>CT: call_tool("ghost_tool", {})
    CT->>DT: dispatch_tool("ghost_tool", {})
    DT->>TS: get_spec("ghost_tool")
    TS-->>DT: None
    DT->>DT: fail(unknown_tool) → raise ToolError
    DT-->>CT: ToolError
    CT-->>SDK: raise（不做二次包装）
    SDK-->>C: isError=true
